---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const canonical = 'https://colotopia.com/en/privacy/';
const altUrl = 'https://colotopia.com/fr/confidentialite/';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Colotopia privacy policy: data collected, cookies, Google AdSense, Google Analytics, GDPR rights and contact details."
  canonical={canonical}
  altUrl={altUrl}
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: April 20, 2026</em></p>

    <p>
      This policy describes how Colotopia (hereinafter "we") collects, uses and protects your
      personal data when you visit colotopia.com. It complies with the General Data Protection
      Regulation (GDPR, EU 2016/679) and with the Google AdSense program requirements.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      The data controller is the publisher of Colotopia. For any question about this policy or
      your personal data, you can reach us at:
      <a href="mailto:contact@colotopia.com">contact@colotopia.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
    <p>Colotopia requires no registration and does not directly collect names, postal addresses or
      phone numbers. The data processed is:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Browsing data</strong> (IP address, browser type, operating system, pages viewed,
        visit duration, traffic source) — collected through Google Analytics if you consent.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising cookies</strong> placed by Google AdSense and its partners to
        personalize ads — only with your consent.</li>
      <li><strong>Data sent by email</strong> when you contact us (your email address and the
        content of your message).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Purposes and legal bases</h2>
    <p>Your data is used to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Measure audience and improve the site (legal basis: <em>consent</em>).</li>
      <li>Display ads, personalized or not (legal basis: <em>consent</em>).</li>
      <li>Reply to your messages (legal basis: <em>pre-contractual request</em>).</li>
      <li>Ensure security and proper site operation (legal basis: <em>legitimate interest</em>).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Consent management (CMP)</h2>
    <p>
      On your first visit, a banner lets you <strong>accept</strong>, <strong>reject</strong> or
      <strong>customize</strong> the placement of non-essential cookies. Your choice is stored
      locally in your browser and you can change it anytime via the
      "<a href="#" onclick="if(window.colotopiaConsent)window.colotopiaConsent.open();return false;">Manage my cookies</a>"
      link.
    </p>
    <p>
      Until you consent, no audience measurement or personalized advertising cookies are placed.
      We use Google Consent Mode v2 to guarantee this behavior.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Google AdSense advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, an advertising service operated by Google LLC,
      to fund the creation and maintenance of our content.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies (notably the <strong>DART</strong> and
        <strong>DoubleClick</strong> cookies) to serve ads on our site.
      </li>
      <li>
        Google's use of the DART cookie enables it to serve ads to users based on their visits to
        our site and other sites on the internet.
      </li>
      <li>
        You may opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting
        <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ad Settings</a>
        or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">aboutads.info/choices</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        Google's rules for the use of advertising data are described here:
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        Third-party vendors authorized by Google may also use cookies to serve ads based on your
        browsing history.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Audience measurement — Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics 4 to measure site audience anonymously (page views, duration, traffic
      source). Data is anonymized and only collected with your consent. Learn more:
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Retention period</h2>
    <p>
      Anonymized browsing data is kept by Google Analytics for a maximum of 14 months. Emails you
      send us are kept as long as needed to handle your request, then deleted or archived for up
      to 3 years.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Transfers outside the European Union</h2>
    <p>
      Google may transfer some data to the United States. These transfers are covered by the
      European Commission's <em>Standard Contractual Clauses</em> and by Google's adherence to the
      <em>EU–US Data Privacy Framework</em>.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Your GDPR rights</h2>
    <p>Under GDPR, you have the following rights:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Right of access</li>
      <li>Right to rectification</li>
      <li>Right to erasure ("right to be forgotten")</li>
      <li>Right to restriction of processing</li>
      <li>Right to object</li>
      <li>Right to data portability</li>
      <li>Right to withdraw consent at any time</li>
      <li>Right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority (e.g.,
        <a href="https://www.cnil.fr" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">CNIL</a> in France)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise your rights, contact us at
      <a href="mailto:contact@colotopia.com">contact@colotopia.com</a>. We reply within 30 days
      maximum.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Minors</h2>
    <p>
      Although part of our content may appeal to children, Colotopia is a general-audience service
      aimed at adults (parents, teachers, artists, teens over 13). We do not knowingly collect data
      from children under 13. If you believe a child has sent us data, write to us at
      <a href="mailto:contact@colotopia.com">contact@colotopia.com</a> for immediate deletion.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Changes</h2>
    <p>
      This policy may be updated to reflect legal or technical changes. The version in force is
      always the one published on this page. The last update date is shown at the top of the
      document.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For any question about this privacy policy or your data:
      <a href="mailto:contact@colotopia.com">contact@colotopia.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #1f2937;
  }
  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: #1f2937;
  }
  .legal-page p, .legal-page li {
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .legal-page p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .legal-page ul {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .legal-page li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
